```python
setning = input("Setning: ").lower().split()
telling = {}
for ord in setning:
    if ord in telling:
        telling[ord] += 1
    else:
        telling[ord] = 1
for ord, antall in telling.items():
    print(f"'{ord}': {antall}")
```

